e in childhood, and makes up a large proportion of embryonal brain tumors. \\n\\n\\n**Definition source (Please give PubMed ID, if applicable, in format PMID:#######)\\n\\n**Children terms (if applicable)** Should any existing terms be re-classified as children underneath this new proposed term? \\n\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID) or URL for a working group**\\nhttps://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40157/\\n\\nThis is a priority disease name for ClinGen. If this request could please be processed as soon as possible, it would be greatly appreciated!\\n\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"GPR161-related medulloblastoma predisposition\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9877\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778614056581,"end":1778614056599}},"id":"prt_e1da8b581001gbyHxk1VaGzgoJ","sessionID":"ses_1e25759a7ffenVC9nmfitzkS1E","messageID":"msg_e1da8a72e001R5hdpLeX6KtF5M"}}
