GenResource)\n\n[youtube.com](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsn4nEVUTpVQz70rClgMMsQ)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Get Started\n\n](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/start/)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Curation Activities\n\n](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/)\n\n-   [About ClinGen's Curation Activities](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/about-curation-activities/)\n-   [Gene-Disease Validity](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/gene-disease-validity/)\n-   [Variant Pathogenicity](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/variant-pathogenicity/)\n-   [Clinical Actionability](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/clinical-actionability/)\n-   [Dosage Sensitivity](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/dosage-sensitivity/)\n-   [Somatic Cancer Variant](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/somatic/)\n-   [Baseline Annotation](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/baseline-annotation/)\n-   [ClinGen Curation of ClinVar](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/clingen-curation-of-clinvar/)\n-   [Browse All ClinGen's Curated Genes](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/curation-activities/results/)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### Tools\n\n](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/tools/)\n\n---\n\n[\n\n###### About Us\n\n](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/)\n\n-   [About ClinGen](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/about-clingen/)\n-   [ClinGen & ClinVar Partnership](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/clingen-clinvar-partnership/)\n-   [ClinGen, CPIC and PharmGKB Partnership](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/clingen-cpic-pharmgkb/) \n-   [ClinGen Opportunities](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/clingen-job-opportunities/)\n-   [Citing ClinGen & Terms of Use](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/terms-of-use/)\n-   [Contact ClinGen](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/contact-clingen/)\n-   [Events & Conferences](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/events/)\n-   [FDA Recognit